## 🎯 Key Learnings

- Terraform workflow: `init → validate → plan → apply → destroy`
- AWS Networking fundamentals (VPC, Subnets, IGW, Route Tables)
- Application Load Balancer setup and Target Group configuration
- EC2 automation using User Data scripts
- High Availability architecture design principles

